	<div class="fsElement fsContent" id="fsEl_16596" data-use-new="true" >

				<div class="fsElementContent" >
			<h2>CCSDO Meeting Schedule, Agendas, Minutes, and Notices</h2>

<p>CCSDO meetings are held on Mondays beginning at 7:00 p.m. and held at the San Mateo County Office of Education&nbsp;(101 Twin Dolphin Drive, Redwood City, CA 94065), unless noted otherwise.&nbsp; Public hearings related to matters before the committee are held throughout the county as required by law.&nbsp; Special meetings may be called by the chairperson or by a quorum of the committee.&nbsp; Meetings are subject to the provisions of the Brown Act.</p>

